Ç1990-1992 yillari arasinda yayimlanan Yurume Uclusu, yurume - de ki iste - tumceler adli ciltlerden olusuyor.
tumceler, yayimlandikca bir tur evrim geciriyor: Eklenen yeni tumcelerle genisliyor, degisiyor... Kitabin simdi satista olan 4. basimi 2002 tarihli."ä	
á	"Vicdanimiz kuruyor. Babalarini erken kaybetmis yetim cocuklarin masum baslarini koyacaklari gogusler coktan coktu, farkinda misiniz? Gogus coktukce zulum tepemizde kaliyor. Kavisli ve dolasik gecmisimizse, bozuk duzenimizin telleri olmus. Duydugunuz sesler bu yuzden icli ve bu kadar derinden geliyor.
Simdi bir turlu sigamayip, delice bir kavgaya tutustugumuz, adina Anadolu denen su kadim topraklarda, binlerce yil once hukum surmus, bir Hitit kralinin ogullarina biraktigi vasiyete bakin isterseniz: Oldugumde beni, usulunce yikayin, gogsunuze yaslayin ve topraga birakin. Bu kadar." Hayatin en yalin ve en efsunlu meseleleri, olum ve yasam, annebaba-cocuk arasindaki zor muhabbet, buyumek ve yaslanmak uzerine... Vefali bir ogulun gozuyle. Bilhassa olumun, olumle basetmenin olaganustulugu ve olaganligi uzerine..."Alismaya"
direnen bir hekimin gozuyle.
Tasranin sicak kucagi ve serin kasveti uzerine... Orayi hem icinden hem disindan bilen bir evladinin gozuyle. Turkiyenin ipin ucundaki yakin tarihinin golgesi... Kalbi avucunda
birinin gozuyle. Ercan Kesaldan, aynanin kenarindaki fotograflar misali hayat
parcalari, sohbet makaminda insan hikayeleri."é
ãFrom a brilliant new talent comes a riveting novel of chance, fate, and numbers, and one man's strange journey past the boundaries of the possible.David Caine inhabits a world of obsession, rich rewards, and rapid, destructive downfalls. A compulsive gambler and brilliant mathematician prone to crippling epileptic seizures, he possesses the uncanny ability to calculate odds of any hand in the blink of an eye. But one night at an underground poker club, Caine makes a costly misscalculation, sending his life spinning out of control. Desperate, he agrees to test an experimental drug with unnerving side effects: inexplicable visions of the past, present, and future. Unsure whether he's perceiving an alternate reality or suffering a psychotic breakdown, Caine embarks on a journey that stretches beyond the possible into the world of the improbable. Gradually, he discovers the extent of his astonishing new ability -- but powerful, shadowy forces know Caine's secret. Now Caine must fight for his survival -- and his sanity . . ."ö
óBen bu ani daha once de yasamamistim sanki..."
Gul bahcesi maziye, kanli bir yolculuk...
Kan ve Gul, fantastik bir polisiye. Rengini kandan, kokusunu gulden alan bir roman. Ziyadesiyle hazin, epey hareketli, hayli komik.
Ikinci sinif ask romanlari cevirmeni, orta siklet avare Aziz, bir yanginda kule donusmek uzereyken, zamanda yolculuk yaparak yirmi yil oncesine doner; ustelik yirmi yas genclesmis bir halde.
Henuz islenmemis bir cinayeti cozmek uzere harekete... gecmesi pekala mumkundur. Karizmatik sosyopat Abdul'un hayatini kurtarmasi... galiba iyi olacaktir. Mazi tesisatini tamir edebilirse, hayati, istikbal musluklarindan temiz ve tazyikli bir su gibi akacaktir. Biricik aski Nergis'ten hic ayrilmayacak, kizi Zeynep'e hakkiyla babalik edecektir.
Peki, bu amator dedektif, kaderin hukmunu degistirebilecek midir?
Maktulu kurtardigina, katili bulduguna memnun olacak midir?
Gelecegi gormek mi daha zordur yoksa gecmisi mi?
Kara mizah ustasi Alper Caniguz, besinci romaninda, kurgu ve anlatimdaki yetkinligini bir adim daha oteye tasiyor."∫
∑"Annem Kuran okurdu, babam ansiklopedi. Ahlakimi annemden, bilimimi babamdan almisim.
Cocuklugum sefertasi gibi bir apartmanda gecti. Uc katliydi, kizartma kokardi."
Yeni bir eve tasiniyorsunuz.
Deli sacmasi, Ispanyol paca mektuplar almaya basliyorsunuz.
Mektuplari yazanin semtinizde bulunan hapishanedeki bir mahkum oldugunu anliyorsunuz.
Bir aksam eve geliyorsunuz ve...
Deli mahkum karsinizda...
Ve sizin kahramani oldugunuzu soyluyor!
Kus kafesi kokan, duvarlari kitap sayfalariyla kapli bir evde spor yazilari yazan inovatif anarsist Ali.
Ugruna hapisten kacilan Selin, ugruna hapise dusulesi cevval Sevval.
Pirlanta asker Muhterem, utanmaz mafyoz Tanju.
Aleksi bir polisiye, Aleksi bir dram, Aleksi Pavlovic.
Tren, katir, traktor ve kahkaha dolu bir yol hikayesi...
Mutevazi Bir Intikam.
"Bizi kelimeler kurtaracak.""ª
∏An honor killing shatters and transforms the lives of Turkish immigrants in 1970s London
Internationally bestselling Turkish author Elif Shafak's new novel is a dramatic tale of families, love, and misunderstandings that follows the destinies of twin sisters born in a Kurdish village. While Jamila stays to become a midwife, Pembe follows her Turkish husband, Adem, to London, where they hope to make new lives for themselves and their children.
In London, they face a choice: stay loyal to the old traditions or try their best to fit in. After Adem abandons his family, Iskender, the eldest son, must step in and become the one who will not let any shame come to the family name. And when Pembe begins a chaste affair with a man named Elias, Iskender will discover that you could love someone with all your heart and yet be ready to hurt them.
Just published to great acclaim in England, Honoris a powerful, gripping exploration of guilt and innocence, loyalty and betrayal, and the trials of the immigrant, as well as the love and heartbreak that too often tear families apart."–
ÕBen Sana Mecburum, Attila Ilhan'in Sisler Bulvari / Yagmur Kacagi donemi siirlerini izleyen uzunca bir surenin urunlerini iceriyor. Toplumcu siirimize oldugu kadar bireyci siirimize de yeni boyutlar kazandiran; halk siiri kaynaklarindan da yararlanan sanatcinin, renkli, zengin, duyarli, ozgun havasini tasiyan ve yansitan siirler..."·
ﬁWITH AN INTRODUCTION BY D. J. TAYLOR
These three brilliant novels span Henry Green's career as a novelist and display his unique talents as a writer. Nothingis a tale of the merry-go-round of love, marriage and infidelity, and the ceaseless tussle of innocence versus experience. Dotingsets the middle-aged male infatuation for pretty girls against the comfortable affection of wives and old friends, delving into the complications of burgeoning affairs and boring marriages. In Blindness, Green's first novel, a young man is blinded in a senseless accident but thereafter discovers new imaginative powers."Ì
ÍGlenn Meade's electrifying novels capture the intrigue of nations, the brutality of war, and the heroism of brave men and women. The Sands of Sakkara is his most satisfying novel yet-a heart-pounding thriller set against the backdrop of wartime Egypt, where a breathless chase across the arid desert explodes, as two people race against time to stop a dark plot in the heart of World War II...Once Rachel Stern was a beautiful archaeologist, until the Nazis herded her behind barbed wire. Once Jack Halder lived between two nations. Now he is filled with rage, chosen to spearhead a desperate secret mission-and to bring Rachel Stern into it. Once Harry Weaver was one of America's best and brightest. Now he is the only U.S. agent who can hunt down the man who was his friend, and the woman they both loved in 1939.
In a stunning story that reaches from the teeming streets of Berlin to the feet of the great pyramids, three former friends are about to meet again: around a mission to assassinate FDR."ˆ
ÛBir suredir televizyonda devam eden Kucuk Seyler adli program bu kitabin olusumuna ilham verdi. Ustun Dokmen Kucuk Seyler kitabinda temel konulara, ozellikle toplumun ihtiyaci oldugunu dusundugu ve seminerlerinde izleyenlerin etkilendiklerini gozlemledigi konulara deginiyor. Programda ele alinan bazi konularin genisletilmesi ve yeni konularin eklenmesiyle olusan kitabin cercevesi insan iliskileri, iletisim hatalari, yasama sevinci, cocuklarla iletisim, eslerle iletisim, rollerimiz, kadin-erkek esitligi... Kucuk Seyler, etrafimizdaki pozitif seyleri gorup hayatimizdaki zorluklari, tuzaklari yok saymayan, aksine tum detaylariyla -Kucuk Seyler'le- bir kez daha gozler onune seren, verdigi ipuclariyla yaklasim ve davranislarimiza isik tutan bir eser."␀␀à@"	ÖÎQ∏@"	\è¬ı(\@"	q=
